{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/wishlist-now.gif?t=1737717176\" /><br><strong>Intense fight sessions of 2-3 minutes follow one another like in a concert. From surprises to surprises, from scenes to scenes, the pace accelerates and leads the dance until the final explosion! </strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/gameplay_SHOOT.gif?t=1737717176\" /><br>A nervous and super dynamic gameplay designed to revive the old-time arcade shoot'em up.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/perso.gif?t=1737717176\" /><br>Three <strong>musician-fighters</strong> with gameplay as stylish as different.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/gameplay_JUMP.gif?t=1737717176\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/weapon.gif?t=1737717176\" /><br>Choose your musical instruments, amps and effects pedals to create <strong>explosive synergies</strong>!<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/gameplay_MOVE.gif?t=1737717176\" /><br>The fun of rhythm games without the difficulty! Each enemy has his dance steps, moves and attacks according to his own score. The hordes of <i>beat-bots</i> advance by creating a <strong>procedural soundtrack</strong>. Move in rhythm, learn their movement and counter-attack with style!<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/croquis.gif?t=1737717176\" /><br>A crazy retrofuturistic world inspired by the steampunk universe of <i>Jules Vernes</i> and the japanese cartoons of <i>Hayao Miyazaki</i>. Discover an ecologic fable about the cycle of life and music.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>&quot;When technology imposes its infernal rhythm<br>When the frantic music of machines exhausts the planet<br>When the Earth cries tears of lava...<br>...Three punk musicians fight to restore balance<br>Even if it means blowing everything up!&quot;</i></h2><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/about_me.gif?t=1737717176\" /><br>Solo dev, creator of <i>Iris and the Giant</i> (<i>Goblinz Studio</i>). I learned to code on my own and start making games 15 years ago. Making a <strong>shoot'em up</strong> is my biggest challenge!<br>I'm also a pop-up book illustrator and graphic designer.<br>---<br>A playable demo (30min) is almost finished :) Playtest are coming soon!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Please <strong>WISHLIST</strong> and <strong>FOLLOW</strong> the game if you like my work :) THANKS!!!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3017100?t=1737717176","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3017100?t=1737717176","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/a9faedb60a3aa8f37b8d7c0ea1c7621a5523709e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737717176","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/a9faedb60a3aa8f37b8d7c0ea1c7621a5523709e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1737717176","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Playtest LavaLoop</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/lavaloop_discord.png?t=1737717176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to playtest LavaLoop, join the Discord server : : </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or send me a message :)</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/wishlist-now.gif?t=1737717176\" /><br><strong>Intense fight sessions of 2-3 minutes follow one another like in a concert. From surprises to surprises, from scenes to scenes, the pace accelerates and leads the dance until the final explosion! </strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/gameplay_SHOOT.gif?t=1737717176\" /><br>A nervous and super dynamic gameplay designed to revive the old-time arcade shoot'em up.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/perso.gif?t=1737717176\" /><br>Three <strong>musician-fighters</strong> with gameplay as stylish as different.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/gameplay_JUMP.gif?t=1737717176\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/weapon.gif?t=1737717176\" /><br>Choose your musical instruments, amps and effects pedals to create <strong>explosive synergies</strong>!<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/gameplay_MOVE.gif?t=1737717176\" /><br>The fun of rhythm games without the difficulty! Each enemy has his dance steps, moves and attacks according to his own score. The hordes of <i>beat-bots</i> advance by creating a <strong>procedural soundtrack</strong>. Move in rhythm, learn their movement and counter-attack with style!<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/croquis.gif?t=1737717176\" /><br>A crazy retrofuturistic world inspired by the steampunk universe of <i>Jules Vernes</i> and the japanese cartoons of <i>Hayao Miyazaki</i>. Discover an ecologic fable about the cycle of life and music.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>&quot;When technology imposes its infernal rhythm<br>When the frantic music of machines exhausts the planet<br>When the Earth cries tears of lava...<br>...Three punk musicians fight to restore balance<br>Even if it means blowing everything up!&quot;</i></h2><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/about_me.gif?t=1737717176\" /><br>Solo dev, creator of <i>Iris and the Giant</i> (<i>Goblinz Studio</i>). I learned to code on my own and start making games 15 years ago. Making a <strong>shoot'em up</strong> is my biggest challenge!<br>I'm also a pop-up book illustrator and graphic designer.<br>---<br>A playable demo (30min) is almost finished :) Playtest are coming soon!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Please <strong>WISHLIST</strong> and <strong>FOLLOW</strong> the game if you like my work :) THANKS!!!</h2>","developers":["Louis Rigaud"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/header.jpg?t=1737717176","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257029144,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257029144/movie480.mp4?t=1719665716","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257029144/movie_max.mp4?t=1719665716"},"name":"Tiny trailer of the demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257029144/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1719665716","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257029144/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1719665716","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257029144/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=171